{"id":"3aa8b43b760f7cdb","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure.md","title":"Autonomous Ordinal Closure","display":"df-autonomous-ordinal-closure — Autonomous Ordinal Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure","aliases":["72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure"],"display":"df-autonomous-ordinal-closure — Autonomous Ordinal Closure","depends_on":["[[72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity, Springer, copyright 2009 (local catalog 2008)","source_location":"Def8.3.2 print136/PDF146; TI print100/PDF110","verification_status":"source-and-signature-reviewed","proof_status":"definition-well-foundedness-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-autonomous-ordinal-closure — Autonomous Ordinal Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a35e12f215cc7e60\" href=\"?note=a35e12f215cc7e60\" title=\"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus\">72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity, Springer, copyright 2009 (local catalog 2008)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Def8.3.2 print136/PDF146; TI print100/PDF110"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-signature-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-foundedness-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a35e12f215cc7e60\" href=\"?note=a35e12f215cc7e60\" title=\"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus\">72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus</a>及其语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\lambda,\\beta\\in\\omega_1\">\\(\\alpha,\\lambda,\\beta\\in\\omega_1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf L^{(2)}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf L^{(2)}\\)</span>是无集合参数的二数值孔模板；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_A\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R_A\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span>及<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(D_A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>由下式引入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lin}(A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Lin}(A)\\)</span>表示它是其域上的严格线性序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>是任一固定集合参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:S\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Phi:S\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>为赋值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(F)\\subseteq S\\in\\operatorname{Fin}(V)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(F)\\subseteq S\\in\\operatorname{Fin}(V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\\models F[\\Phi]\">\\(\\mathcal N\\models F[\\Phi]\\)</span>为下式定义的标准数语义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OT}(A,\\beta)\">\\(\\mathsf{OT}(A,\\beta)\\)</span>通过序同构定义，不是新的良基性预言机。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bij}(b,D,\\beta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Bij}(b,D,\\beta)\\)</span>表示集合函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>的定义域为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>、值域为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>且单射。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lim}\">\\(\\operatorname{Lim}\\)</span>为非零极限序数类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*\">\\(\\lambda^*\\)</span>及<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Aut}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\omega_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Aut}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\omega_1\\)</span>由下式定义。所有集合量词和交集在ZFC元语言中解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\\models\\langle\\in,t,X\\rangle[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ v(t)\\in\\Phi(X),\\quad\\mathcal N\\models\\langle\\notin,t,X\\rangle[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ v(t)\\notin\\Phi(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal N\\models\\langle\\in,t,X\\rangle[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ v(t)\\in\\Phi(X),\\quad\\mathcal N\\models\\langle\\notin,t,X\\rangle[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ v(t)\\notin\\Phi(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\\models F[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\mathcal N\\models\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)[\\Phi]\\quad(F\\in\\mathsf W),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal N\\models F[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\mathcal N\\models\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)[\\Phi]\\quad(F\\in\\mathsf W),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\\models F[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\mathcal N\\models\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)[\\Phi]\\quad(F\\in\\mathsf D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal N\\models F[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\mathcal N\\models\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)[\\Phi]\\quad(F\\in\\mathsf D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_A:=\\{(m,n)\\in\\omega^2:\\mathcal N\\models A(m,n)[\\varnothing]\\},\\quad D_A:=\\{n\\in\\omega:\\exists m\\in\\omega\\ ((m,n)\\in R_A\\lor(n,m)\\in R_A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_A:=\\{(m,n)\\in\\omega^2:\\mathcal N\\models A(m,n)[\\varnothing]\\},\\quad D_A:=\\{n\\in\\omega:\\exists m\\in\\omega\\ ((m,n)\\in R_A\\lor(n,m)\\in R_A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lin}(A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ R_A\\subseteq D_A^2\\land\\forall x\\in D_A\\ (x,x)\\notin R_A\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D_A\\ [((x,y)\\in R_A\\land(y,z)\\in R_A)\\Rightarrow(x,z)\\in R_A]\\land\\forall x,y\\in D_A\\ [x\\ne y\\Rightarrow((x,y)\\in R_A\\lor(y,x)\\in R_A)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Lin}(A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ R_A\\subseteq D_A^2\\land\\forall x\\in D_A\\ (x,x)\\notin R_A\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D_A\\ [((x,y)\\in R_A\\land(y,z)\\in R_A)\\Rightarrow(x,z)\\in R_A]\\land\\forall x,y\\in D_A\\ [x\\ne y\\Rightarrow((x,y)\\in R_A\\lor(y,x)\\in R_A)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OT}(A,\\beta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists b\\ [\\operatorname{Bij}(b,D_A,\\beta)\\land\\forall m,n\\in D_A\\ ((m,n)\\in R_A\\Longleftrightarrow b(m)\\in b(n))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{OT}(A,\\beta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists b\\ [\\operatorname{Bij}(b,D_A,\\beta)\\land\\forall m,n\\in D_A\\ ((m,n)\\in R_A\\Longleftrightarrow b(m)\\in b(n))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_A(n):=\\bigvee_{m\\in\\omega}(A(m,n)\\lor A(n,m)),\\quad P_A(X):=\\bigwedge_{n\\in\\omega}\\left(B_A(n)\\to\\left[\\left(\\bigwedge_{m\\in\\omega}(A(m,n)\\to\\langle\\in,\\dot m,X\\rangle)\\right)\\to\\langle\\in,\\dot n,X\\rangle\\right]\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_A(n):=\\bigvee_{m\\in\\omega}(A(m,n)\\lor A(n,m)),\\quad P_A(X):=\\bigwedge_{n\\in\\omega}\\left(B_A(n)\\to\\left[\\left(\\bigwedge_{m\\in\\omega}(A(m,n)\\to\\langle\\in,\\dot m,X\\rangle)\\right)\\to\\langle\\in,\\dot n,X\\rangle\\right]\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TI}(A,X):=P_A(X)\\to\\bigwedge_{n\\in\\omega}(B_A(n)\\to\\langle\\in,\\dot n,X\\rangle),\\qquad\\lambda^*:=\\min\\{\\delta\\in\\operatorname{Lim}:\\lambda&lt;\\delta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TI}(A,X):=P_A(X)\\to\\bigwedge_{n\\in\\omega}(B_A(n)\\to\\langle\\in,\\dot n,X\\rangle),\\qquad\\lambda^*:=\\min\\{\\delta\\in\\operatorname{Lim}:\\lambda&lt;\\delta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Aut}(\\alpha):=\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq\\omega_1:\\ &amp;\\alpha\\in S\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in S\\ (\\lambda^*\\subseteq S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in S\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf L^{(2)}\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\omega_1\\ [\\mathsf{Lin}(A)\\land\\operatorname{rk}(A)&lt;\\lambda\\land\\mathsf{OT}(A,\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\exists\\xi,\\rho&lt;\\lambda\\ (\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\xi}\\{\\mathsf{TI}(A,X)\\})\\ \\Rightarrow\\beta\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Aut}(\\alpha):=\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq\\omega_1:\\ &amp;\\alpha\\in S\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in S\\ (\\lambda^*\\subseteq S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in S\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf L^{(2)}\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\omega_1\\ [\\mathsf{Lin}(A)\\land\\operatorname{rk}(A)&lt;\\lambda\\land\\mathsf{OT}(A,\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\exists\\xi,\\rho&lt;\\lambda\\ (\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\xi}\\{\\mathsf{TI}(A,X)\\})\\ \\Rightarrow\\beta\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是8.3.2的最小闭包定义，将“公式定义的序”与“证明其超限归纳”展开为语言、语义、序同构和四规则演算。field使用源书的关系域；单点序的不同载体约定不影响自治闭包，因为所有有限序数已由后继闭包进入。ω1本身满足闭包条件，故交集非空且仍满足全部条件；每个λ*可数。证明规则的可靠性由高度归纳推出：有TI证明的线性序不能有ω下降链（取其良基部分作为X即可反证）。因此OT的存在不是额外自治假设，只把源书otyp的部分函数写成定义图；其唯一性由良序型唯一性保证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"a35e12f215cc7e60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"a35e12f215cc7e60","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用[[72-df-pohlers-infinitary-calculus]]及其语言。$\\alpha,\\lambda,\\beta\\in\\omega_1$。$A\\in\\mathsf L^{(2)}$是无集合参数的二数值孔模板；$R_A\\subseteq\\omega^2$及$D_A\\subseteq\\omega$由下式引入，$\\mathsf{Lin}(A)$表示它是其域上的严格线性序。$X\\in V$是任一固定集合参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\lambda,\\beta\\in\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf L^{(2)}","display":false},{"tex":"R_A\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"D_A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lin}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:S\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(F)\\subseteq S\\in\\operatorname{Fin}(V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N\\models F[\\Phi]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{OT}(A,\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bij}(b,D,\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Aut}(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N\\models\\langle\\in,t,X\\rangle[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ v(t)\\in\\Phi(X),\\quad\\mathcal N\\models\\langle\\notin,t,X\\rangle[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ v(t)\\notin\\Phi(X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal N\\models F[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\mathcal N\\models\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)[\\Phi]\\quad(F\\in\\mathsf W),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal N\\models F[\\Phi]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{CS}(F))\\ \\mathcal N\\models\\operatorname{CS}(F)(i)[\\Phi]\\quad(F\\in\\mathsf D).","display":true},{"tex":"R_A:=\\{(m,n)\\in\\omega^2:\\mathcal N\\models A(m,n)[\\varnothing]\\},\\quad D_A:=\\{n\\in\\omega:\\exists m\\in\\omega\\ ((m,n)\\in R_A\\lor(n,m)\\in R_A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lin}(A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ R_A\\subseteq D_A^2\\land\\forall x\\in D_A\\ (x,x)\\notin R_A\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D_A\\ [((x,y)\\in R_A\\land(y,z)\\in R_A)\\Rightarrow(x,z)\\in R_A]\\land\\forall x,y\\in D_A\\ [x\\ne y\\Rightarrow((x,y)\\in R_A\\lor(y,x)\\in R_A)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{OT}(A,\\beta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists b\\ [\\operatorname{Bij}(b,D_A,\\beta)\\land\\forall m,n\\in D_A\\ ((m,n)\\in R_A\\Longleftrightarrow b(m)\\in b(n))].","display":true},{"tex":"B_A(n):=\\bigvee_{m\\in\\omega}(A(m,n)\\lor A(n,m)),\\quad P_A(X):=\\bigwedge_{n\\in\\omega}\\left(B_A(n)\\to\\left[\\left(\\bigwedge_{m\\in\\omega}(A(m,n)\\to\\langle\\in,\\dot m,X\\rangle)\\right)\\to\\langle\\in,\\dot n,X\\rangle\\right]\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TI}(A,X):=P_A(X)\\to\\bigwedge_{n\\in\\omega}(B_A(n)\\to\\langle\\in,\\dot n,X\\rangle),\\qquad\\lambda^*:=\\min\\{\\delta\\in\\operatorname{Lim}:\\lambda<\\delta\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Aut}(\\alpha):=\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq\\omega_1:\\ &\\alpha\\in S\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in S\\ (\\lambda^*\\subseteq S)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in S\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf L^{(2)}\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\omega_1\\ [\\mathsf{Lin}(A)\\land\\operatorname{rk}(A)<\\lambda\\land\\mathsf{OT}(A,\\beta)\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\exists\\xi,\\rho<\\lambda\\ (\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\xi}\\{\\mathsf{TI}(A,X)\\})\\ \\Rightarrow\\beta\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4176,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-248","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure|df-autonomous-ordinal-closure — Autonomous Ordinal Closure]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-autonomous-ordinal-closure — Autonomous Ordinal Closure](72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure|df-autonomous-ordinal-closure — Autonomous Ordinal Closure]]"},{"id":"5f74371081322951","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)\\subseteq\\omega_1$是[[72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure]]的自治闭包；它使用Pohlers的$\\mathsf L_{\\omega_1}$公式与$\\mathsf{NT}_{\\rho}^{\\xi}$，不是任意给定理论族的序数界。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-autonomous-ordinal-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["a35e12f215cc7e60"]}